- Intestinal epithelial xenobiotic-metabolism heatmap

Selected summary outputs include:

```text
results/developmental/pseudobulk/DEG/pseudobulk_DEG_summary.csv
results/developmental/pseudobulk/pathways/pathway_enrichment_summary.csv
results/developmental/pseudobulk/pathways/intestinal_1dpf_vs_5dpf_cyp_xenobiotic_genes.csv
plots/developmental/intestinal_xenobiotic_CYP450_heatmap.png
```

## Limitations

- Only **two biological replicates per developmental stage** were available for pseudobulk comparisons.
- Global cell-level DEG tests can be influenced by pseudoreplication and differences in cell-type proportions.
- Cell-type annotations are computational assignments based on marker evidence and may require independent validation.
- GO/KEGG overrepresentation and heatmap patterns do not directly measure pathway activity.
- The dataset uses processed expression matrices, so read alignment and primary sequencing QC were outside this project's scope.

